<title>USA: U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices mostly steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices mostly steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash bids for millfeeds were mostly steady on Monday amid sluggish dealings in an abbreviated week, marked by Friday's observance of Independence Day, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The grain markets are taking most of the attention,&quot; one St Louis dealer said, referring to the sharp setback in CBOT soybeans and soymeal and the declines in corn and wheat.  </p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-408-8720))</p>
